Hello Roman,

Thanks for your email, finally I managed to solve the problem myself:
I was working in RStudio and after converting my haploid data to a genind
object, I was trying to save it as a file for further use in the DAPC
webserver.
I was using the wrong code, I was trying to write a table from a genind
object, as csv.
But then, did the following:

*save(Ugenind1, file = "Ugenind1.Rdata")*

which worked !

I am new to R and adegenet :)

best,

eugenia




